AETV is derived from the SSTVAE project (https://github.com/arodland/SSTVAE).
The OFDM numerology, Golay(24,12) codec, and Watterson channel model follow
that work. The Flex-8k video mode, training recipe, and ham inference harness
are new to this repository.

